  → Add `model StatusBadge` to `schema.prisma` with `id String @id @default(uuid())`, `name String`, `createdAt DateTime @default(now())` and `updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt`, then run `prisma generate`.
  → Mount the routes in `src/index.ts` with `app.route("/status-badges", statusBadgeRoutes(new StatusBadgeService(new DrizzleStatusBadgeRepository(db))))`, where `db` is your Drizzle database.
  → Mount the routes in `src/index.ts` with `app.route("/status-badges", statusBadgeRoutes(new StatusBadgeService(new PrismaStatusBadgeRepository(prisma))))`, where `prisma` is your `PrismaClient`.
